==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From {{compound|en|apple|jack}}, referring to the ''increase'' in alcohol concentration due to freeze distillation.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# An alcoholic drink similar to apple [[brandy]] and [[calvados]], made by freeze-distilling ("jacking") [[apple cider]].

